{"at":"2026-11-21T21:26:34.499Z","kind":"said","text":"The list is set up and copied to your clipboard, so you can paste it into a file for next time. It has four lines:\n\n```\nbin/\nobj/\npackages/\nnode_modules/\n```\n\nNothing was saved on the page itself. The download button did nothing because this window keeps no downloads, so the clipboard copy is the way to keep it. Paste it into a text file, such as `skip.gitignore-style.txt`, and paste it back into the \"Your list\" box on the next folder.\n\nI did not use the built-in \"What these folders hold\" preset. It's a long list of paths specific to this one DNN tree, so it wouldn't carry over to other folders. I also didn't click Scan. With the four lines in place, the page shows 10,939 files to read and 6,305 left out."}
